Slipstream is designed to be shaped around your workflow using standard TiddlyWiki tagging conventions and configuration tiddlers. You never need to modify theme core code.

---

! 1. Pinned Navigation Shortcuts

You can pin notes, hubs, and frequently visited topics to the **Left Navigation Rail**:

* Tag any note with `[[$:/tags/Pinned]]`.
* (Optional) Add a `caption` field (e.g. `Index`, `Writing`, `Projects`).
* (Optional) Add an `ss-icon` field (e.g. `🗂️`, `✍️`, `🌊`) or standard `icon` field.
* Reorder pinned shortcuts by editing the tag list in [[$:/tags/Pinned]] or using drag-and-drop in [[$:/ControlPanel]].

To customize the filter used for pinned shortcuts, edit `$:/config/slipstream/pinned-filter` in [[$:/plugins/mblackman/slipstream/settings]].

---

! 2. Wide Layout Breakout (`1120px`)

By default, Slipstream centers notes at `840px` for reading comfort.

When you want a tiddler to expand to full dashboard width (`1120px`):
* Tag the note `Wide`, OR
* Add the field `page-width: wide`.

You can customize the breakout filter (`$:/config/slipstream/wide-filter`) or container width (`$:/config/slipstream/wide-width`) in Settings.

---

! 3. Extensible Left Navigation Sections

You can add custom sections to the Left Navigation Rail:

1. Create a new tiddler.
2. Tag it with `[[$:/tags/Slipstream/LeftNav]]`.
3. Write any wikitext, filter list, or widget inside the tiddler body.

---

! 4. Extensible Context Inspector Tabs

The Right Context Inspector can be extended with your own custom tabs:

1. Create a new tiddler.
2. Tag it with `[[$:/tags/Slipstream/InspectorTab]]`.
3. Add a `caption` field (e.g. `Graph`, `Tasks`, or `Citations`).
4. In the body, write any wikitext or filter you wish.

Your custom tab will automatically render in both the desktop Right Inspector and the mobile Context bottom sheet!

---

! 5. Inline Property Header Pills

Slipstream can render metadata fields as sleek pills directly underneath the tiddler title:

* **Global Defaults**: Listed in `$:/config/slipstream/default-property-fields` (default: `status priority mood rating media-type creator due-date`).
* **Per-Note Override**: Add an `ss-fields` field to any tiddler with a space-separated list of field names (e.g. `ss-fields: version author license`).
* **Interactive Dropdown Options**: Create a tiddler titled `$:/config/slipstream/field-options/<field-name>` containing space-separated option values (e.g. `Draft Active Archived`) to turn that property pill into an interactive `<select>` dropdown!
